    {
      "id": "claim_9336804600c44b148cc2451869c24f9c",
      "statement": "`GET /v1/processes/{process_slug}` returns details for a single process looked up by `process_common_slug` (with fallback to the older `process_slug` column): statistics (beans, roasters, countries, converted avg price), top countries, top roasters, the ten most common tasting notes, and the original raw process names with per-name bean counts.",
