      "id": "claim_0c09e65ebd954f3088c7fe766a787ff7",
      "statement": "`normalize_process_name()` NFKD-normalises unicode, strips to ASCII, lowercases, and hyphenates to produce URL-friendly slugs (e.g. `anaerobic-natural`), and the `process_common_slug` column is indexed (`idx_origins_process_common_slug`) to support slug-based lookups by the detail endpoints.",
