    {
      "id": "claim_85a85a93c83645f38e8b97b16e747796",
      "statement": "`dedupe_mappings_static` collapses pure case-variant duplicates deterministically by keeping the 'nicest' representative entry, preferring entries with lowercase letters, then higher confidence, then names matching the canonical, then earliest position in the file; genuine conflicts (different common_name for the same lowercased key) are left intact for human review.",
