      "statement": "The process detail endpoint and the uniqueness-report flow both link processing method to origin geography (top countries per process, roaster standout insights via `process_common_name`) and to the tasting note taxonomy (the ten most common tasting notes per process), making the process-to-origin and process-to-flavour relationships explorable through the API and frontend.",
